Author: zWaR <4272114+zWaR@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Thu Oct 15 08:25:57 2026 -0400

    feat(gitlab): add work item parent and type methods

    GitLab's REST issues API cannot detach a work item from its parent or
    change its type, so a task created as a child had to be fixed by hand
    in the web UI. Tasks are also left off issue boards, which made such
    items disappear from planning once detached from their parent.

    Wrapping the work-item GraphQL mutations keeps these fixes inside
    swamp, with type names resolved against the project's own work item
    types and no-op behaviour when the item is already in the target state.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

